[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0010","text":"──好，甜花！\n去发挥练习的成果吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0020","text":"我，我知道了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0021","text":"拍摄工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0030","text":"那么，配合快门时机\n拜托啦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0040","text":"……嗯\n画得很漂亮呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0050","text":"谢谢\n拍到了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0060","text":"太好了……！\n谢谢，你们……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0070","text":"甜花，辛苦了\n干得漂亮！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0080","text":"嘿嘿……\n因为努力了，所以好开心……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0090","text":"……这样一看\n配合场地和服装，总觉得……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500400_03_0100","text":"像魔法一样，呢……"}]
